name subfigmat
category Package
revision 20308
shortdesc Automates layout when using the subfigure package
relocated 1
longdesc Defines an array/matrix-type environment that is used with the
longdesc subfigure package to automate the placement of subfigures (or
longdesc tables or text). The subfigures are placed left-to-right,
longdesc top-to-bottom.
runfiles size=2
